<title>SRI LANKA: Weather-Rain seen over many parts of Sri Lanka.</title>
<headline>Weather-Rain seen over many parts of Sri Lanka.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's metereological department released the following rainfall figures for 24 hours ending Monday morning</p>
<p>Hydro catchment areas (in mm):</p>
<p>    Bowathenna		0</p>
<p>    Canyon		    0</p>
<p>    Castlereigh	     0</p>
<p>    Kotmale		   0</p>
<p>    Laxapana		  0</p>
<p>    Moussakele		0</p>
<p>    Norton		    0</p>
<p>    Randenigala	     4.7</p>
<p>    Victoria		 40.4</p>
<p>    Samanalawewa	    2</p>
<p>    Ukuwela		   0</p>
<p>    Rantembe		  8.1</p>
<p>The department forecast thundershowers in the western, southern and sabaragamuwa provinces and afternoon or evening thundershowers in the central, uva and northwestern provinces.</p>
</text>
